00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:34,000
Asteroid-a-Geddon is a science fiction, action film directed by Geoff Meed.

3
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:18,000
A global scientific summit debates and fails on a plan to stop a massive asteroid heading
straight for Earth, with all countries blaming each other for the impeding disaster.

4
00:22:56,000 --> 00:23:02,000
With communications tense, the daughter of a tech billionaire assembles her own team
of specialists to try to destroy the asteroid before it is too late.

5
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:46,000
General Quinn, played by Eric Roberts.

