11
01:03:04,000 --> 01:03:10,000
The Asylum is an American independent film company and distributor that
focuses on producing low-budget, direct-to-video films.

12
01:08:48,000 --> 01:08:54,000
The company has produced titles that capitalize on productions by major studios, often using film titles
and scripts very similar to those of current blockbusters in order to lure customers.

13
01:14:32,000 --> 01:14:38,000
These titles have been dubbed "mockbusters" by the press.

14
01:20:16,000 --> 01:20:22,000
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
